## 18. Known Limitations of This Audit

- This audit is read-only. No code was executed from the target repository.
- Findings are based on static analysis and agent-based review, not runtime behavior.
- Agent outputs reflect pattern matching and structural analysis, not deep semantic understanding.
- Scores are heuristic and penalty-based; they should be interpreted as guidance, not absolute truth.
- Blueprint alignment is approximate when no blueprint document was provided.
- Security findings are indicative and must be confirmed by a human security review.
- Observability and MLOps scoring may be incomplete without runtime environment access.
- Re-running the audit after changes is recommended to verify improvements.
